<Policy title="Research use only policy" description="Research use only policy for Energy Peptides.">
<p>Every product sold by Energy Wellness Club LLC, trading as Energy Peptides, is supplied for laboratory research use only. Products are not for human or veterinary use, and are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, mitigate or prevent any disease or condition.</p>
<h2>What this means</h2>
<ul>
<li>Products are sold as research chemicals to researchers, laboratories and institutions.</li>
<li>Product pages describe chemistry and the published research record. They do not describe effects in humans.</li>
<li>We do not provide, and will not answer questions about, human administration.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Purchaser attestation</h2>
<p>By placing an order, the purchaser confirms that they are at least 21 years old, that they are purchasing solely for laboratory research, and that they understand the products are not for human or veterinary use. Orders that do not meet these conditions will be cancelled and refunded.</p>
<h2>Regulatory status</h2>
<p>These products have not been evaluated or approved by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration.</p>
</Policy>
